================================================================================
   +------------------------------------------------------------+
   | Any AI / automated system in public decision-making is     |
   | routed to ONE of three paths.                              |
   |                                                            |
   | Impact Severity (rights/safety/economic) : ordinal 1-5     |
   | Scalability (reach/reversibility/systemic): ordinal 1-5    |
   +------------------------------------------------------------+
   | FULL CYCLE if ANY of:                                      |
   |   (i)   fundamental-rights trigger fires (system capable   |
   |         of affecting a listed fundamental right)           |
   |   (ii)  any single dimension = 5                           |
   |   (iii) both dimensions >= 4                               |
   | LIGHT PATH otherwise.                                      |
   | EMERGENCY if imminent public hazard / temporal crisis.     |
   |                                                            |
   | Scores are ORDINAL. No multiplication. Doubt defaults UP.  |
   | The scorer publishes written reasons for each score.       |
