   |   Scoring officer inside the deploying agency, apart from  |
   |   the project team. Identity and written reasons for each  |
   |   score published on the Registry.                         |
   +------------------------------------------------------------+
   | CHALLENGE                                                  |
   |   Any person, CSO or parliamentary minority >= 10% may     |
   |   challenge a score within 14 days. IRA decides within 21  |
   |   days. Default-up applies meanwhile. The IRA decision is  |
   |   subject to general expedited review (see Judicial        |
