   |   re-characterising it to stay Light, is VOID. The         |
   |   Registry issues a fragmentation alert when two or more   |
   |   registered actions share > 60% subject overlap within    |
   |   180 days. Overlap is measured by the IRA composite       |
   |   index: shared objective-function family, shared affected |
   |   population, shared data inputs, or shared decision type. |
