================================================================================
   ARCHITECTURAL INVARIANT
================================================================================
   Neither urgency nor audit authority may be captured.
   The emergency regime is a NARROW, TIMED, AUDITED EXCEPTION,
   never a permanent government mode.

   Anti-circumvention is itself a constitutional guarantee,
   at the gate and in the emergency regime alike. Any attempt
   to structure successive limited decisions, or to
   re-characterise the same subject matter, to escape the
   60-day ceiling or the 180-day chaining prohibition is
   grounds for NULLITY and PERSONAL LIABILITY.

   THE LAW OF STOP IS INSTITUTIONAL, NOT TECHNICAL.
   A single off button is a dangerous illusion. Layered
   authority (L1-L4) with safe state, restart authority,
   stop-failure drills and independently verified shadow
   drills is the enforceable minimum.

   ALGORITHMIC SOVEREIGNTY IS NOT NATIONAL HOSTING:
   interface is not infrastructure. Objective-function
   provenance disclosure, vendor tagging duties and a
   bounded trade-secret rule are the difference between
   algorithmic sovereignty and algorithmic colonialism.

   NO REGULATOR IS UNREGULATED.
   The IRA is audited by the National Audit Office and the
   Accredited Expert Pool, is reviewable by courts, and is
   barred from operating the systems it supervises.

   THE REGIME IS MEASURED AGAINST ITS OWN CLAIMS.
   Procedural compliance is audited AND the Cognitive
   Sovereignty factors are evaluated every 2-3 years against
   direction-sensitive, target-banded indicators with a
   published recalibration methodology.


